function rhymeScheme(text){const ls=lines(text),groups=[],letters='ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ',keys=[];for(const line of ls){const w=endWord(line),key=w.slice(-3);let i=keys.indexOf(key);if(i<0){keys.push(key);i=keys.length-1;}groups.push(letters[i]||'?');}return groups.join('');}
const FORMS=Object.freeze({
 haiku:{lines:3,syllables:[5,7,5],strict:false,note:'For English haiku, 5/7/5 can be a useful target rather than a universal rule; image, juxtaposition, compression, and seasonal or natural awareness may matter more.'},
 tanka:{lines:5,syllables:[5,7,5,7,7],strict:false},
 limerick:{lines:5,rhyme:'AABBA',meterHint:'strong anapestic or amphibrachic swing'},
 sonnet:{lines:14,meterHint:'often iambic pentameter; rhyme depends on tradition'},
 common_measure:{lines:4,syllables:[8,6,8,6],rhyme:'ABAB or ABCB'},
 free_verse:{strict:false,note:'No fixed meter or rhyme required; analyze lineation, image, syntax, sound, repetition, and pacing.'}
});
function analyzePoetry(text,form='free_verse'){const ls=lines(text),spec=FORMS[form]||FORMS.free_verse,counts=ls.map(lineSyllables),scheme=rhymeScheme(text),issues=[];if(spec.lines&&ls.length!==spec.lines)issues.push({code:'FORM_LINE_COUNT',expected:spec.lines,actual:ls.length,severity:spec.strict?'warning':'note'});if(spec.syllables)counts.forEach((n,i)=>{if(spec.syllables[i]!=null&&n!==spec.syllables[i])issues.push({code:'FORM_SYLLABLE_TARGET',line:i+1,expected:spec.syllables[i],actual:n,severity:spec.strict?'warning':'note'});});return {form,lines:ls.length,syllables:counts,rhymeScheme:scheme,spec,issues};}
async function analyzePoetryAsync(text,form='free_verse'){const result=analyzePoetry(text,form),lex=global.StoryTools?.WriterReference?.offlineLexicon;if(!lex)return result;const counts=[];for(const line of lines(text)){let n=0;for(const w of line.match(/[A-Za-z]+(?:['’-][A-Za-z]+)*/g)||[])n+=await lex.syllables(w);counts.push(n);}return {...result,syllables:counts,phonetic:true};}
function analyzeLyrics(text){const parts=[];let current={label:'section',lines:[]};for(const line of String(text||'').split(/\r?\n/)){const m=line.trim().match(/^\[(verse|chorus|pre-chorus|bridge|hook|intro|outro|refrain)(?:\s+\d+)?\]$/i);if(m){if(current.lines.length)parts.push(current);current={label:m[1].toLowerCase(),lines:[]};}else if(line.trim())current.lines.push(line.trim());}if(current.lines.length)parts.push(current);const all=parts.flatMap(p=>p.lines),norm=all.map(x=>x.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z ]/g,'').trim()),counts=new Map();for(const l of norm)counts.set(l,(counts.get(l)||0)+1);return {sections:parts.map(p=>({label:p.label,lineCount:p.lines.length,syllables:p.lines.map(lineSyllables),rhymeScheme:rhymeScheme(p.lines.join('\n'))})),hookCandidates:[...counts].filter(x=>x[1]>1&&x[0]).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]).slice(0,12).map(([text,count])=>({text,count})),hasRecurringSection:parts.some(p=>/chorus|refrain|hook/.test(p.label))};}
const NOTES=Object.freeze(['C','C#','D','D#','E','F','F#','G','G#','A','A#','B']),FLAT={Db:'C#',Eb:'D#',Gb:'F#',Ab:'G#',Bb:'A#'},SCALES=Object.freeze({major:[0,2,4,5,7,9,11],natural_minor:[0,2,3,5,7,8,10],dorian:[0,2,3,5,7,9,10],mixolydian:[0,2,4,5,7,9,10],pentatonic_major:[0,2,4,7,9],pentatonic_minor:[0,3,5,7,10],blues:[0,3,5,6,7,10]});
function pitchClass(note){const m=String(note||'C').match(/^([A-Ga-g])([#b]?)/);if(!m)return 0;let n=m[1].toUpperCase()+(m[2]||'');n=FLAT[n]||n;return Math.max(0,NOTES.indexOf(n));}
function scale(root='C',type='major'){const pc=pitchClass(root);return (SCALES[type]||SCALES.major).map(i=>NOTES[(pc+i)%12]);}
function midi(note='C4'){const m=String(note).match(/^([A-Ga-g])([#b]?)(-?\d+)$/);if(!m)return null;return (Number(m[3])+1)*12+pitchClass(m[1].toUpperCase()+m[2]);}
